{
  "name": "dsh-porthole",
  "version": "1.4.3",
  "description": "DSH 本机门户：反向代理 + 双密码门禁 + 会话投影剥离 + 远程工作区管理，支持 nginx 子域名/二级目录，可绑定指定网卡。",
  "releaseNotes": "【v1.4.3】① 修复设置面板添加工作区后，新建对话报 SessionPersistenceNotFoundError（session-1 not found）：添加工作区只注册目录，会话交给 DSH 原生流程创建并持久化。② 修复开启门禁后 manifest / favicon 因浏览器未携带 Cookie 而返回 401，仅允许指定资源匿名 GET/HEAD，并遵守挂载前缀。③ 新增 3 项回归测试，全部 36 项测试通过。升级后请完整重启 DSH 并刷新页面，清除旧的内存空会话。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": "./client/client.js",
    "./locale/*": "./locale/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "GAP-REPORT.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build:client": "node client/build.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build:client",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "qrcode": "^1.5.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^18.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^18.3.1"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
